|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260415/zhanbao_image_1944209_1776200212_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260415/zhanbao_image_1944209_1776200212_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">巴黎2-0击败利物浦，以两回合总比分4-0淘汰利物浦挺进四强，将对阵拜仁和皇马之间的胜者。</span></p><p><strong>【赛后声音】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-15/69deb15010bfdnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">弗里克：本有机会3-0领先 我们运气不太好 一些细节还需改进</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260415/202604150528374841.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260415/202604150528374841.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260415/202604150528374841.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">欧冠1/4决赛次回合，巴萨2-1、总比分2-3遭马竞淘汰。弗里克赛后接受了采访。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-15/69deaed6546c8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">德容：少一人作战总会让局面更艰难 这次运气没站在我们这一边</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260415/202604150523133574.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260415/202604150523133574.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260415/202604150523133574.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">赛后在接受Movistar采访时，巴萨中场德容表示，球队付出了一切。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-15/69deb66012e8cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">斯洛特：本赛季有太多不利判罚了，想想1-0的安菲尔德会是什么样</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.36" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260125/69753349dd2b0.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.36" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.36" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260125/69753349dd2b0.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260125/69753349dd2b0.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">欧冠8强次回合结束，利物浦总比分0-4不敌巴黎。赛后，斯洛特质疑了利物浦被取消的点球。</span></p><p><strong>【其他新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-15/69de50b8b2d3enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">欧冠4强决出2席：巴黎静候皇仁大战胜者，马竞将战阿森纳葡体胜者</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260415/202604150512164711.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260415/202604150512164711_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260415/202604150512164711_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">欧冠1/4决赛两组对决结束，巴黎、马竞率先锁定4强。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-15/69de706ebbfd8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">率队首夺美职联！迈阿密官方：马斯切拉诺因个人原因辞去主帅一职</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260415/202604150132441079.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260415/202604150132441079.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260415/202604150132441079.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">迈阿密国际官方消息，主帅马斯切拉诺因个人原因辞去主帅一职。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-15/69de9f32e4005native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">埃基蒂克疑似跟腱重伤！若确认将无缘世界杯，红军争5同样受重创</a></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">利物浦vs巴黎上半场，埃基蒂克无对抗伤退，他倒地时痛苦捂着脚踝、跟腱部位，下场时在担架上双手捂脸。尽管现在无法马上有确定的消息，但队报、RMC等媒体也都表示可能是跟腱。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-15/69de6b4fcf57cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">贝林：也许我和维尼修斯姆巴佩在左路聚集太多 我需找到攻守平衡</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.47" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260415/202604150037035884.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.47" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.47" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260415/202604150037035884.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260415/202604150037035884.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">欧冠1/4决赛次回合，皇马将客战拜仁，首回合皇马1-2失利。赛前，皇马中场贝林厄姆出席了新闻发布会，他谈到了自己和球队目前的一些情况。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-15/69de6e0ce3ecenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿韦洛亚：上一场拜仁门将是全场最佳 不会把明天的胜利视为奇迹</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.39" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260415/202604150049292057.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data